- * QUSB2 PHY at 0x088e2000; its power domain is the USB30_PRIM GDSC and its
- * clocks come from GCC (offsets from Linux gcc-sdmmagpie.c). ABL uses this
- * controller for fastboot; this probe only reports what state it is left
- * in after `fastboot boot`. It never writes a register, and it touches the
- * DWC3 / PHY register blocks only when the GCC status registers say their
- * power domain and clocks are on (an access to a gated block would hang).
+ * guacamole USB: Synopsys DWC3 at 0x0a600000 behind Qualcomm's
+ * dwc-usb3-msm wrapper, used high-speed only, with the SNPS femto HS PHY at
+ * 0x088e2000. Power domain USB30_PRIM GDSC, clocks from GCC (gcc-sm8150.c).
+ * sweetusb=1 only reports the state ABL leaves after `fastboot boot`;
+ * sweetusb=2 powers the controller and PHY up (usb_guac_power_up) and runs
+ * device mode with the CDC-ECM live log. DWC3 / PHY registers are touched
+ * only when the GCC status registers say their power domain and clocks are
+ * on (an access to a gated block would hang).
  */
